Package: jsonstructure
Type: Package
Title: JSON Structure Schema and Instance Validation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Clemens", "Vasters", email = "clemensv@microsoft.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("JSON Structure Contributors", role = "cph"))
Description: R bindings for the JSON Structure validator, providing schema
    validation and instance validation against JSON Structure schemas. The
    package binds to the JSON Structure C library ('json_structure') for the
    performance-critical validation work: a small compiled shim loads a
    prebuilt shared library that is downloaded from GitHub Releases on first
    use (mirroring the Ruby SDK). Additional extension-keyword checks (units,
    relations, alternate names and identifier rules) are performed in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/json-structure/sdk, https://json-structure.org
BugReports: https://github.com/json-structure/sdk/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: GNU make. A C compiler is required to build the package.
    At first use the package downloads a prebuilt 'json_structure' shared
    library from GitHub Releases (network access required) unless the
    JSONSTRUCTURE_LIB_PATH environment variable points at a local build.
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
